refactor: migrate from Supabase to self-hosted Docker + PostgreSQL

- Replaced Supabase (auth, database, storage) with self-hosted solution
- Added Drizzle ORM with PostgreSQL (docker-compose)
- Implemented JWT auth with argon2 password hashing (httpOnly cookies)
- Created local filesystem storage for covers and zips
- Added API layer (server-side handlers for auth, projects, versions, tags, webhooks)
- Created Docker + docker-compose setup for EasyPanel deployment
- Added Dockerfile and .env.example
- Updated all components to use new API client
- Removed all Supabase dependencies from codebase

BREAKING: Requires PostgreSQL and Docker for deployment. No longer uses Supabase.

